      <Mandatory>false</Mandatory>
      <Validation></Validation>
      <Description><![CDATA[None (default), Float (gentle up and down), Drift (slow wander) or Sway (slight rocking). Each card moves a little out of step. Off for visitors who reduce motion.]]></Description>
